"reentrancy": {
  "intake": {
    "reentrant": true,
    "because": "It reads a request and writes a message: no disk, no network and no state of its own. Two submissions in flight are two manifests the colony rolls off one after the other, in the order they reach the mutation door -- and because a manifest has no rollback, that order is the colony's to decide and never this cell's to assume."
